   "en": "The daily life of Yumemi, a third year at Shirahadai Middle School. Surrounded by a colorful cast of students and teachers, there's never a dull moment to be found at school.\n\nIncluded in Volume 1:  **The Blue Sea**: A short poem manga centered a man longing for his wife, who left him all too soon.\n\nIncluded in Volume 2: **Spring in the Green Forest** (グリーンフォーレストの春, Green Forest no Haru):  An unpublished work."
